      "version": 166,
      "versionNonce": 1718093219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773759147929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "细节：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "细节：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jJIK3MzynjJMNOw1_LZIW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35.97140091098845,
      "y": 372.8148710074047,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1548931821,
      "version": 107,
      "versionNonce": 1345721187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773759141719,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. signal函数的返回值也是这种函数指针的类型，这个意思是你设置了一个新的函数指针，\n后面按这个新的方法去使用，这个返回值其实是老的处理方法，也就是你设置的方法的上一\n个方法。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. signal函数的返回值也是这种函数指针的类型，这个意思是你设置了一个新的函数指针，后面按这个新的方法去使用，这个返回值其实是老的处理方法，也就是你设置的方法的上一个方法。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q119ceo7DYTEJDYyg9Dsc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35.211421662941575,
      "y": 466.8148710074047,
      "width": 694.3199462890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1697242723,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1827889901,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773759144599,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 我们设定的自定义捕捉方法的参数代表什么，sig代表的是收到的信号编号。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 我们设定的自定义捕捉方法的参数代表什么，sig代表的是收到的信号编号。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
