      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 760701864,
      "version": 271,
      "versionNonce": 1513570264,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773794571174,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这三个系统调用是层层递进的，第一个是给任意进程发生任何信号，第二个是自己发送任意\n信号，第三个是给自己发送6号信号",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这三个系统调用是层层递进的，第一个是给任意进程发生任何信号，第二个是自己发送任意信号，第三个是给自己发送6号信号",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GKU_b_E0f6hfmKgF6PTYw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31.941447908058763,
      "y": 3022.81486337801,
      "width": 534.4599609375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1838405592,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 1600928680,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773794643104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 如何理解键盘输入 -- 键盘是基于硬件中断来进行工作的！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 如何理解键盘输入 -- 键盘是基于硬件中断来进行工作的！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WpJmLsZV30R-ckaW3TamL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28.251537019386888,
      "y": 3064.214918309651,
      "width": 756.2398681640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1209545128,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 778267096,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Kgx_FJNrDlbmX_nRGxG2m",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1773795582474,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. OS如何解释快捷键 - ctrl + c, ctrl + \\等其他的快捷键，可能会直接解释成为信号",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. OS如何解释快捷键 - ctrl + c, ctrl + \\等其他的快捷键，可能会直接解释成为信号",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rKLU2NMGSIlWA8t15nqSS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27.011348420754075,
      "y": 3108.3148938955883,
      "width": 782.719970703125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 167451864,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 559104680,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773794726914,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. OS怎么知道信号发送给哪一个进程呢 -- 键盘输入的信号只能发送给前台进程(组)，而\n且前台进程只有一个！！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. OS怎么知道信号发送给哪一个进程呢 -- 键盘输入的信号只能发送给前台进程(组)，而且前台进程只有一个！！",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
