      "text": "硬件中断",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "硬件中断",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y_dL52mizeTHBAdHJgrkx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1184.7714802566916,
      "y": 3228.7148572744945,
      "width": 796.7999877929688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1500391896,
      "version": 647,
      "versionNonce": 25579176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773795472303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "操作系统之所以能知道“键盘被按了”，不是因为它会主动去查看键盘，而是因为硬件层面的\n“中断”机制通知了它。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "操作系统之所以能知道“键盘被按了”，不是因为它会主动去查看键盘，而是因为硬件层面的“中断”机制通知了它。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kZWysdJoHVzcS_1979xUr",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1180.771571809426,
      "y": 3204.114881688557,
      "width": 807.9998779296874,
      "height": 153.60000610351568,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFg",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 447367896,
      "version": 469,
      "versionNonce": 1867686616,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773795476713,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RX8u9Ve5cQ9xUrXh2WAnX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1189.631435090676,
      "y": 3301.5148450674633,
      "width": 783.8798828125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 613926872,
      "version": 552,
      "versionNonce": 2081831336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773795472303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "总结： 不是操作系统“知道”键盘有数据，而是硬件通过“中断”强制告诉了CPU，CPU再让\n操作系统去处理。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "总结： 不是操作系统“知道”键盘有数据，而是硬件通过“中断”强制告诉了CPU，CPU再让操作系统去处理。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
