    {
      "id": "jbVEKxqIGYkagVw6mfXSr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 889.5615498367697,
      "y": 2985.014997655354,
      "width": 790.4197998046875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1715797976,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 1368626648,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Kgx_FJNrDlbmX_nRGxG2m",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1773795598115,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "键盘的字符既有“ABCD……”这样的正常的字符，也有“Ctrl C”“Ctrl V”……这样的组合键\n操作系统会把组合键解释成信号（会判断，ctrl c是特殊字符，在ASCII码表里存在）——\n操作系统会有系统调用：给目标进程发送信号——kill(pid,signum)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "键盘的字符既有“ABCD……”这样的正常的字符，也有“Ctrl C”“Ctrl V”……这样的组合键\n操作系统会把组合键解释成信号（会判断，ctrl c是特殊字符，在ASCII码表里存在）——操作系统会有系统调用：给目标进程发送信号——kill(pid,signum)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
