      "seed": 383866280,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 1232420520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773797674427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "会话内部至少包含一个进程组(bash)，会话的本质是由一个或多个进程组构成的进程组的\n集合，通常会有属于自己的终端文件。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "会话内部至少包含一个进程组(bash)，会话的本质是由一个或多个进程组构成的进程组的集合，通常会有属于自己的终端文件。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2uo7Yb08Qg5IIgKg_O7Fl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1151.2815205398947,
      "y": 6247.614790135823,
      "width": 585.3798828125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1175735512,
      "version": 912,
      "versionNonce": 1218914728,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773797674427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "通过fg [任务号]把后台任务变成前台之后，就可以Ctrl C删掉了。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "通过fg [任务号]把后台任务变成前台之后，就可以Ctrl C删掉了。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
